OL,3,GNEWSAAirport set to be bought by mayor
OL,4,Ain landmark deal
OL,5,
OL,6,FDoncaster Sheffield Airport (DSA) is
OL,7,Fset to come under public ownership,
OL,8,Fwith politicians on the cusp of
OL,9,Fagreeing a deal with landowner Peel.
OL,11,FSouth Yorkshire Mayoral Combined
OL,12,FAuthority (SYMCA) will buy the airport
OL,13,Fand adjacent Innovation Quarter
OL,14,Femployment land - totalling more than
OL,15,F1,000 acres - subject to the deal going
OL,16,Fthrough.
OL,18,FIt means SYMCA would become the
OL,19,Ffreehold owner and landlord to the City
OL,20,Fof Doncaster Council lease.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
