OL,3,GNEWSAAirport set to be bought by mayor
OL,4,Ain landmark deal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lengthy report with the financial
OL,7,Fdetails will go before senior
OL,8,Fcouncillors next week, but SYMCA
OL,9,Fofficers say the "project is not
OL,10,Fwithout risk to the taxpayer given the
OL,11,Fsums of public funding involved".
